      "text": "Traffic Advisory\n\nIn Connection with PWD Work near Petrol Pump, Majnu Ka Tila | 15.07.2025 (Tuesday), traffic movement will be affected during late-night hours.\n\nDiversions will be in place on Outer Ring Road between Chandgiram Akhara, Wazirabad Flyover, and ISBT Kashmere Gate.\n\nPlan your journey accordingly and avoid the affected stretches between 01:30 AM to 03:00 AM.\n\n#DTPUpdates",
